e=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwaystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石碑</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.9.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-minimap-fair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero 的小地圖 (公平遊玩)</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fzenith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zenith</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.9.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zenith-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zenith 屬性</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v1.8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>推薦</h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a> 模組</strong>：可移動快捷欄，避免紋理被裁切；</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/nbtpack-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NBTpack 草地磚插件資源包</a></strong>：傾斜物品顯示，使擁有長紋理的物品（例如劍）在圓角物品欄中不會顯得突兀。</li>\n</ul><h3>Minecraft 資源包版本相容性</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fPack_format\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 資源包格式</a></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft 資源包版本</th>\n<th>Cobblemon 介面版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>&lt;= v0.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>&gt;= v0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>&gt;= v1.4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>內含項目</h3><p>本專案包含一個改編版本的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpoketips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon 工具提示</a> 資源包。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpoketips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://api.mcbanners.com/banner/saved/LZrReFoiohJHWs.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></a></p><h2>其他：</h2><p>紋理基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/torrezx-improved-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torrezx-Improved Library</a> 資源包的書本，並參考了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fSbIA8FKhwl0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《阿爾宙斯傳說》預告片</a> 開頭書本的風格。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1091579923396820992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.0/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> 在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Cobblemon Discord 伺服器</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-interface-modded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>",
